# Level reference (unshifted / shifted):
# AltGr `: grave/tilde; apostrophe: acute/diaeresis; 6: circumflex/quarter;
# 7: horn/half; 8: ogonek/threequarters; 2: squared/doubleacute;
# 3: cubed/macron; 5: euro/cedilla; 9: quote/breve; 0: quote/ring;
# minus: yen/belowdot; period: abovedot/caron; slash: inverted-question/hook.
# Plain US is reusable independently of the international layer.
